{"id": "counter-strike-source", "title": "Counter-Strike: Source", "steam": 240, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": null, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["The 64-bit build (cstrike_win64.exe) starts and plays on the default engine through DXVK on an M4, but the frame rate falls hard while the mouse moves, so cap it at 60 for now (highball#482). The same session hit Wine 10's limit of 256 realized fonts ('out of realized font handles'); the Wine 11 engine allows 5000. Nothing was measured here."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "The frame rate falls from about 350 fps to under 100 while the mouse or trackpad moves, which feels like mouse lag (reported on an M4, macOS 27.0.1, DXVK, engine r28, highball#482)", "cause": "not measured. The cost follows the frame rate, so likely Wine's Mac cursor handling done once per frame. Turning off vertical sync and switching m_rawinput did not change it", "fix": "cap the frame rate at 60 (Highball's frame cap in the environment's settings, or fps_max 60 in the game's console), which made it playable for the reporter"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/counter-strike-source.json"},
{"id": "cpm-2", "title": "CPM 2", "steam": 4252340, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": null, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Car Parking Multiplayer 2 does not start on either engine: UnityPlayer.dll fails to initialize before the game writes its Player.log, on D3DMetal and on DXMT alike, without the bottle's winhttp override too. Players on Linux report it running under Proton (ProtonDB, 8 reports by 2026-10-21), so a protection that refuses Wine is unlikely. Advertise AVX to games has not been tried yet. Nothing was measured here."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "The game never shows a window: UnityPlayer.dll fails to initialize at startup (reported on an M1, macOS 27.0.1 and 15.7.8, engines r21 and r28, D3DMetal and DXMT, highball#295 and #435)", "cause": "not found. It fails inside Unity's startup, before Player.log is written", "fix": "none known"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/cpm-2.json"},
