{"id": "dune-spice-wars", "title": "Dune: Spice Wars", "steam": 1605220, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 5, "last": "2026-10-18"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Reported not starting: the game's OpenGL renderer asks for a context macOS's OpenGL cannot provide, and the switch Highball sets for 3.2 core contexts (CX_FWD_COMPAT_GL_CTX) was in place. Whether the game can be made to use its DirectX renderer instead, which would go through DXMT, is being asked on the report. Play passes hlbootdx.dat so the game starts on DirectX instead of OpenGL, from outside reports, not run here."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "'OpenGL Error: unable to create an OpenGL context, OpenGL 3.2+ is required' at launch (reported on an M3, highball#206).", "cause": "the game's OpenGL path asks for a context macOS does not offer; not looked at beyond the dialog yet.", "fix": "Start it on DirectX: Play passes hlbootdx.dat as a launch option, the fix CrossOver players use (AppleGamingWiki, CodeWeavers' tip). Setting Driver = DirectX in options.ini in the game folder does the same. Not run here (highball#206)"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/dune-spice-wars.json"},
