{"id": "ez2on-reboot-r", "title": "EZ2ON REBOOT : R", "steam": 1477590, "status": "community", "backends": {"mac": "dxvk"}, "antiCheat": {"names": ["XIGNCODE3"], "verdict": "warning"}, "reports": {"count": 3, "median": 5, "last": "2026-11-13"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["A rhythm game, reported perfect over 38 minutes on DXVK on the default engine, and playable with minor issues a second player did not describe after a one minute session on r26. The anti-cheat map lists XIGNCODE3 for it, and the reporter's session went through, so whatever the game ships did not stop it under Wine on this copy. The dxvk.conf lines in the report (customDeviceId, maxAvailableMemory, enableAsync off) are scoped to csgo.exe by Highball's Counter-Strike 2 recipe and do not apply to this game. No frame rate was given and nothing was measured here. The second player saw the notes and the music out of sync until the display ran at 60 Hz, and the bottom edge of the game window slightly cut off. Reported perfect again on an M1 Pro with the game on DXVK on the default engine (r28) over 13 minutes (highball-db#1187)."], "knownIssues": [], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/ez2on-reboot-r.json"},
