{"id": "five-nights-at-freddys-secret-of-the-mimic", "title": "Five Nights at Freddy's: Secret of the Mimic", "steam": 2215390, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 4, "last": "2026-10-20"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Reported playable on the default engine with DXMT over a 78-minute session, with one annoyance: the mouse cursor shows up when the view is turned toward a corner of the screen. The reporter sees the same in other first-person games such as Poppy Playtime, and not in native Mac games. The bottle had been set up for Counter-Strike 2, whose dxvk.conf section covers csgo.exe alone, so none of it reaches this game. Nothing was measured here."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "The mouse cursor appears and moves around when the view is turned toward a corner of the screen (reported on an M4, macOS 27.2, DXMT, engine r28)", "cause": "not investigated. The reporter sees it in other first-person games under Highball too, so it is likely Wine's mouse handling on macOS rather than this game", "fix": "none known yet"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/five-nights-at-freddys-secret-of-the-mimic.json"},
