{"id": "hellblade-senuas-sacrifice", "title": "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice", "steam": 414340, "status": "community", "backends": {"mac": "dxmt"}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 3, "last": "2026-10-29"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Reported working fully on an M5 with DXMT over 94 minutes once the game is started with -dx11, which Play passes from the next Highball version (until then put -dx11 in the game's Launch arguments under Game settings). Without it the game takes its DirectX 12 path, which DXMT does not have."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "Does not start in DXMT mode without -dx11", "cause": "the game picks DirectX 12, which DXMT does not provide", "fix": "start it with -dx11. Play passes it from this page from the next Highball version. Until then put it in Launch arguments under the game's Game settings"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/hellblade-senuas-sacrifice.json"},
