{"id": "helldivers-2", "title": "HELLDIVERS 2", "steam": 553850, "status": "blocked", "backends": {"mac": "d3dmetal"}, "antiCheat": {"names": ["Easy Anti-Cheat"], "verdict": "blocked"}, "reports": null, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [{"type": "env", "name": "ROSETTA_ADVERTISE_AVX", "value": "1", "platforms": ["mac"]}], "notes": ["DirectX 12 only, so it needs Apple's D3DMetal (Play offers the licence) and the Wine 11 engine (CrossOver 26.3 tree), which is where CrossOver users play it. Its first check is the CPU: it requires AVX2 and refuses to start with 'Incompatible CPU detected' unless AVX is advertised through Rosetta, which the recipe does. GameGuard runs in user mode and CrossOver users play online through it; every game patch can break that until the next one. 135 GB on disk. Since patch 7.2.0 on 2026-10-20 the game uses Easy Anti-Cheat in place of GameGuard (Arrowhead's announcement, with Linux and Steam Deck support kept through Proton's Easy Anti-Cheat runtime). That runtime has no macOS build, so the game stops at Easy Anti-Cheat's start on a Mac and is out of reach for Highball and CrossOver alike while it holds (highball#439, an M5, 2026-10-22). What follows describes the game before the switch.", "The game checks for AVX2 before anything else and stops with 'Incompatible CPU detected' when Rosetta hides it (Highball's default). This recipe advertises it. Rosetta supports AVX2 on macOS 15 and later.", "DirectX 12 only: needs Apple's D3DMetal, which Play offers with Apple's licence, on the Wine 11 engine (CrossOver 26.3 tree) that CrossOver users play it on. GameGuard runs in user mode and CrossOver 26 users play online through it; a game patch can break that until the next one. Not verified on Highball yet: the first report that reaches the ship is the row."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "'Incompatible CPU detected' at launch", "cause": "the game requires AVX2 and Rosetta hides AVX unless asked", "fix": "the recipe sets ROSETTA_ADVERTISE_AVX=1 (same as the Advertise AVX switch); Rosetta supports AVX2 on macOS 15 and later"}, {"symptom": "No DirectX 12 device on the default engine", "cause": "the game is DirectX 12 only; DXMT and DXVK are DirectX 11 and 9", "fix": "D3DMetal on the Wine 11 engine, which Play offers"}, {"symptom": "After the CPU check passes, the game warns that the GPU drivers are out of date (installed AMD 65535.65535.65535.65535), and after Continue it shows a black screen for a few seconds, closes, and opens the PlayStation crash reporter (reported on an M4 Pro with 24 GB, macOS 26.6.2, engine x64-crossover26.3-r7, D3DMetal, highball#81).", "cause": "a deadlock inside the game right after start, read from the reporter's full log on 2026-09-24: about a minute in, a game thread waits on one of the game's own critical sections (at 0x14190d008, inside its image) held by another thread that never releases it, RtlpWaitForCriticalSection times out at 60 s, and the process exits. What the holding thread is stuck on is not in the log. Three helper processes in the same session die of an NSException (-[NSViewBackingLayer setDisplaySyncEnabled:], sent by MoltenVK to a layer that is not a CAMetalLayer) right after creating a Vulkan instance, but those are not the game. CrossOver 26.2 lists a fix for Helldivers 2 not launching after a game update, and the only change naming the game in CrossOver 26.3's open Wine source (CW Hack 26536, set the app icon once) is already in Highball's Wine 11 engines, so that fix is not in the open code.", "fix": "none known yet. Not reproducible here, the game is not owned and is 135 GB."}, {"symptom": "The game stops while Easy Anti-Cheat starts, or does not start at all (reported on an M5, macOS 27.0.1, engine x64-sikarugir10.0_6-r29, highball#439)", "cause": "by the report, the game moved from GameGuard to Easy Anti-Cheat, which has no Mac Wine support", "fix": "none. It is the same under CrossOver, by the reporter"}, {"symptom": "'Incompatible CPU detected' at launch", "cause": "AVX2 required, AVX hidden under Rosetta", "fix": "this recipe sets ROSETTA_ADVERTISE_AVX=1"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/helldivers-2.json"},
