{"id": "hue", "title": "Hue", "steam": 383270, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 5, "last": "2026-10-07"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Plays at 120 fps on a base M1 on a Wine 11 engine with DXMT, the Epic copy (highball-db#369). On the default Wine 10 engine the sound stuttered in every mode. It's a 32-bit game, so an environment in D3DMetal mode draws it through DXMT anyway. No built-in DualSense support, an XInput controller works."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "The sound stutters, with some video stutter, in every graphics mode (M1, the default Wine 10 engine r22 to r29)", "cause": "not diagnosed. Other 32-bit games had slow or broken sound on Wine 10 that the Wine 11 engines r30 and r31 fixed, which may be the same thing here (a guess)", "fix": "a Wine 11 engine with DXMT plays it at 120 fps on an M1 (highball-db#369, 2026-11-09, credit udance4ever)"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/hue.json"},
