{"id": "nuclear-option", "title": "Nuclear Option", "steam": 2168680, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 3, "last": "2026-10-12"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Reported playable on an M1 after workarounds the player has not described yet. With the environment on DXVK the game stayed on an endless loading screen after its main menu. The second report ran the environment on D3DMetal. The reporter got past the endless loading screen with a steam_appid.txt file holding 2168680 in the game's folder, which the recipe now writes; mods built as DLLs did not load for them.", "Without this file the game can sit on its loading screen after the main menu for good; with it the game's Steam support initialises on its own and the load finishes (a player's fix, highball#322)."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "An endless loading screen after the main menu", "cause": "Not diagnosed. Seen with the environment on DXVK (highball#322)", "fix": "a file named steam_appid.txt containing 2168680 in the game's folder (the reporter's fix, highball#322); the nuclear-option recipe writes it"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/nuclear-option.json"},
{"id": "ocean-world-eden-crafters-prologue", "title": "Ocean World: Eden Crafters Prologue", "steam": 2811830, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 1, "last": "2026-11-02"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Does not start on a Mac. The game is built on libGDX with LWJGL3 and asks for an OpenGL 4.3 context, above the 4.1 that macOS offers."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "Never opens a window, WGL fails to create an OpenGL context (GLFW_VERSION_UNAVAILABLE)", "cause": "the game asks for an OpenGL 4.3 core context (and a 4.4 one before it), and macOS's OpenGL stops at 4.1, so Wine's Mac driver refuses them (WINEDEBUG=warn+wgl, highball-db#922)", "fix": "none on a Mac for now. No engine or graphics mode changes it"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/ocean-world-eden-crafters-prologue.json"},
