{"id": "outdrive", "title": "OutDrive", "steam": 441870, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 5, "last": "2026-11-12"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Reported perfect on an M5 Pro with the game set to DXMT on the Wine 11 engine r30, a steady high frame rate over 18 minutes. On DXVK it played until about minute 8, when the boss helicopter appeared without its model and then the world turned black, so the player says DXMT is a must."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "On DXVK the boss helicopter appears without its model at about minute 8, only its shots visible, then the world turns black with only the overlay left (M5 Pro, Wine 11 r30, highball-db#1181)", "cause": "not diagnosed", "fix": "set the game to DXMT on its page, as the reporter did"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/outdrive.json"},
{"id": "outer-wilds", "title": "Outer Wilds", "steam": 753640, "status": "community", "backends": {"mac": "dxvk"}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 5, "median": 5, "last": "2026-10-27"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Reported perfect after a four-minute session on DXVK on an M2 Pro with macOS 26.6.2, so the report covers launch and the opening; the reporter had not tested much yet. Frame rate not recorded. It also plays perfectly on DXMT, the default mode, on an M5 Pro over 46 minutes. A player on an M1 Pro rates it perfect over two long sessions, with two small notes. It takes two to three minutes to run smoothly, and the other travelers are invisible, only their instruments show."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "The other travelers are invisible, only their instruments show (reported on an M1 Pro, engine r21, mode not stated)", "cause": "not investigated", "fix": "none known yet. The DXMT report on an M5 Pro does not mention it."}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/outer-wilds.json"},
