{"id": "peak", "title": "PEAK", "steam": 3527290, "status": "community", "backends": {"mac": "dxvk"}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 4, "median": 4, "last": "2026-11-08"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Works on DXVK, the default mode. The maintainer played it at about 30 fps on an M1 Pro; settings were not recorded, so the number is what was seen, not a measurement of the best the machine can do. CrossOver reports on the same chip reach 60 fps on medium to high, so there is headroom to find. Known from CrossOver users: the Steam overlay can break friend invites, and shadows flicker on some setups. Checked here on 2026-10-05 on an M4 with engine r21 (DEP kept on), started from Steam with the environment in DXMT mode rather than the row's DXVK: after the EULA it opens on its voice chat and microphone screen."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "On DXMT the window opens and stays frozen or blank (three captures ten seconds apart identical; measured 2026-09-18 on an M1 Pro, macOS 26.6.2, engine x64-sikarugir10.0_6-r5)", "cause": "not diagnosed; the same build draws and plays on DXVK", "fix": "keep the game on DXVK, which is the verified mode"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/peak.json"},
