{"id": "planet-zoo-2", "title": "Planet Zoo 2", "steam": 3219030, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 1, "last": "2026-10-18"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Does not start on the Rosetta engines: its anti-tamper relies on hardware debug registers, which Rosetta does not provide, and then loops without a window until it exits. D3DMetal is never reached. Highball's native arm64 preview engine implements x86 debug registers in FEX and Wine, untested with this game."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "No window; the game runs at 100% CPU for one to six minutes and exits with c0000409", "cause": "the anti-tamper sets hardware debug registers, which Rosetta cannot provide (Wine fakes success), and then faults on the same instruction in a loop (highball-db#537)", "fix": "none on the Rosetta engines. Untested: the arm64 preview engine, which implements debug registers"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/planet-zoo-2.json"},
