{"id": "space-engineers-2", "title": "Space Engineers 2", "steam": 1133870, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 1, "last": "2026-11-07"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Doesn't start in one report on an M3 Max with D3DMetal: the game's GPU check rejects the adapter because it reports no double-precision shader operations, which Apple GPUs don't have. The game is Direct3D 12 only, so DXMT and DXVK are no way around it. Keen lists Intel Arc A-series failing the same check on Windows, by the report. GeForce NOW streams the Steam version."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "Exits at start with \"No supported GPU found\" (M3 Max, D3DMetal, Wine 10 r28)", "cause": "the game's GPU check needs double-precision (FP64) shader operations, which D3DMetal reports as missing and Apple GPUs don't have (the game's render log, highball-db#1061). Whether the game would run if told yes isn't known", "fix": "none known. GeForce NOW streams the Steam version"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/space-engineers-2.json"},
