{"id": "spiritvale", "title": "SpiritVale", "steam": 3767850, "status": "blocked", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": {"names": ["Easy Anti-Cheat"], "verdict": "blocked"}, "reports": null, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Anti-cheat: Easy Anti-Cheat. Proton's EAC support works through a Linux-native runtime (easyanticheat_x64.so) that Proton loads beside the game; there is no such runtime for Wine on macOS and Wine cannot load Linux libraries, so the bootstrap fails here whatever the engine. Only Epic can change that."], "knownIssues": [], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/spiritvale.json"},
