{"id": "the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth", "title": "The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth (Repentance+)", "steam": 250900, "status": "community", "backends": {"mac": "dxmt"}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 11, "median": 5, "last": "2026-11-05"}, "nativeMac": true, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Steam 250900 is the Rebirth base game; Repentance+ is its expansion and what the reports played. On the r5 engine and Highball 0.9.27 the same player calls it perfect over a four-hour session on DXMT (M2 Max, macOS 27); an earlier report on r5 and 0.9.27 saw the frame rate degrade over a long session, cleared by restarting the game. Frame rate not measured here. The Mac build on Steam stops at Afterbirth+, and Repentance is Windows only, so this row marks the Mac build as not the one to play (highball#223). An M4 report (engine r11) sees slight frame drops in rooms crowded with enemies, mostly in Greed mode. Another perfect report, two and a half hours on DXMT on an M4 with engine r17. Two more, almost five hours on an M1 on macOS 15 (rated 4, nothing named) and an hour and a half on an M2 on the Wine 11 engine (perfect). A short perfect report on an M1 Pro with engine r28 (3 minutes). Another perfect report, almost two and a half hours on an M1 with DXMT on engine r28."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "Slows down after a while of play (reported on DXMT, M2 Max, macOS 27, engine r5)", "cause": "not diagnosed; reported as lag building up over a long session", "fix": "Quit the game and start it again, the reporter says that helps a lot"}, {"symptom": "Slight frame drops in rooms with many enemies, more often in Greed mode (reported on an M4, DXMT, engine r11)", "cause": "not diagnosed", "fix": "None reported"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth.json"},
