{"id": "watchmen-the-end-is-nigh", "title": "Watchmen: The End is Nigh", "steam": 21010, "status": "community", "backends": {}, "antiCheat": null, "reports": {"count": 1, "median": 1, "last": "2026-11-03"}, "nativeMac": false, "optIn": false, "requires": [], "steps": [], "notes": ["Doesn't start in one report on an M1. Its MultiLauncher.exe asks for the .NET Framework to be enabled, though .NET 4.8 is installed in the environment. It's a 32-bit game."], "knownIssues": [{"symptom": "MultiLauncher.exe says the .NET Framework must be enabled from Windows Features, with .NET 4.8 installed", "cause": "not diagnosed. PCGamingWiki says the game needs .NET Framework 3.5, which .NET 4.8 doesn't provide, so the launcher most likely wants 3.5 (inferred, not checked here)", "fix": "none in Highball yet. Winetricks has a dotnet35 verb, untested with this game. The CLI's 'highball tricks' runs winetricks verbs but doesn't give winetricks the app's cabextract, which dotnet35 needs, so it most likely stops there"}], "verified": null, "source": "db/games/watchmen-the-end-is-nigh.json"},
